# Restore this external dependency at its pinned commit; preserve provenance.
/UnrealGame/Plugins/UnrealMCP/*
!/UnrealGame/Plugins/UnrealMCP/UPSTREAM.md

# Old patch contains upstream context; the restore helper carries the local fixes.
/tools/scripts/unreal-plugin-fixes.patch
